{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>!mrak</strong> is a first-person shooter with immersive sim elements set in an alternate 2003 Hokkaido, which became part of Russia in the mid-20th century. A techno-hub hidden behind neon signs and dark facades. Here, power is divided between corporations, intelligence agencies, and those who remain in the shadows.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You are a tool in someone\u2019s game. Your goal is to find the target, eliminate them, and disappear. How? That\u2019s your choice. Sneak across rooftops, hide in the shadows, disable cameras\u2026 or leave a bloody trail behind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582290/extras/world.png?t=1741798511\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Freedom of approach and an interactive world: Hide in the dark, hack systems, or charge in headfirst. Guards, cameras, hidden pathways\u2014use the environment to your advantage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582290/extras/tools.png?t=1741798511\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Tools:From makeshift implants to Soviet weaponry. Branching levels: Industrial complexes, skyscraper rooftops, underground clubs\u2014find your own path.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582290/extras/mrak.png?t=1741798511\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A world caught between eras and cultures: Vintage electronics, the hum of CRTs, worn-out cassette tapes, and the cold lights of the metropolis. Soviet legacy, Japanese traditions, and Western influences create a unique atmosphere.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3582290?t=1741798511","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582290/b34a68a2bb555a76